WEBVTT

00:00:12.590 --> 00:00:15.880
<i>One day, I realized I had nothing.</i>

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:15.910
One day, I realized I had nothing.

00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:22.150
<i>The pockets I thought were 
filled with happiness</i>

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:24.620
The pockets I thought were filled with happiness
were actually completely empty.

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:24.400
<i>were actually completely empty.</i>

00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:31.730
<i>I had never put in the effort 
to fill them with anything,</i>

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:33.380
I had never put in the effort to fill them with anything, 
so that was only natural.

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:33.100
<i>so that was only natural.</i>

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:41.390
<i>But I couldn't even understand that.</i>

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:41.890
But I couldn't even understand that.

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:45.730
<i>Because I had ambled along</i>

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:48.980
Because I had ambled along
through an aimless, insubstantial life.

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:48.490
<i>through an aimless, insubstantial life.</i>

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:54.200
<i>And then one day, suddenly,</i>

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:54.530
And then one day, suddenly,

00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:58.840
<i>I sensed that I had lost a great deal of time.</i>

00:00:55.780 --> 00:00:58.870
I sensed that I had lost a great deal of time.

00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:05.540
<i>I have to start over.</i>

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:07.040
I have to start over.

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:13.420
<i>And do everything right next time.</i>

00:01:10.590 --> 00:01:14.380
And do everything right next time.

00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:36.250
I have to go.

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:54.210
<i>The deserted city stimulates
my boyish sense of adventure.</i>

00:02:10.790 --> 00:02:12.480
<i>My body feels extremely light.</i>

00:02:12.810 --> 00:02:14.240
<i>Maybe I could even fly.</i>

00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:27.830
Yeah, right!

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:34.910
Oh, so the nights here are bright.

00:03:10.630 --> 00:03:12.120
Hey, you there.

00:03:16.530 --> 00:03:18.380
What are you doing here—

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:43.340
You've gotta be kidding me...

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:08.440
Ow.

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:13.520
Oh, it was just a dream?

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:17.230
It seemed awfully real, though.

00:04:19.270 --> 00:04:21.780
<i>But I think I've seen that 
girl somewhere before...</i>

00:04:24.350 --> 00:04:26.420
Could she be my lover from a past life?

00:04:26.420 --> 00:04:28.480
Or maybe a fated rival?

00:04:28.730 --> 00:04:31.300
Yeah, right.
 Who am I, Yoshino?

00:04:31.820 --> 00:04:32.810
That reminds me,

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:35.220
didn't I have something 
to take care of today?

00:04:36.490 --> 00:04:38.630
Who could it be at this hour?

00:04:40.270 --> 00:04:42.800
My daughter, Kotori, has not come home.

00:04:43.070 --> 00:04:46.090
Please, bring her back for me.

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:49.180
Right away, madam.

00:04:50.150 --> 00:04:53.930
<i>This is Madam Rikako, the mother of 
my childhood friend, Kanbe Kotori.</i>

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:59.130
<i>A mere plebeian like me
wouldn't dare defy someone so classy.</i>

00:05:04.810 --> 00:05:06.310
<b>Kazamatsuri City Park</b>

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:08.820
<i>To be honest, this isn't the first time</i>

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:10.830
<i>I've gone to pick up her lost daughter.</i>

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:13.840
<i>The forest has always been
a playground for children.</i>

00:05:14.150 --> 00:05:17.450
<i>But Kotori alone, to this day,
 keeps coming back.</i>

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:20.480
<i>She keeps on playing in this 
forest all by herself.</i>

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:23.210
<i>I find that just a little bit sad.</i>

00:05:28.630 --> 00:05:30.650
Hey, Kotori!

00:05:30.650 --> 00:05:32.100
Kotori-san!

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:37.520
Oh, it's just a cat?

00:05:38.380 --> 00:05:40.230
Don't scare me like tha—

00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:47.080
Oh, it's just a...

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:48.490
Just a...

00:05:50.220 --> 00:05:52.240
What is this creature?

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:56.350
I think I've seen this face before...

00:05:58.120 --> 00:05:59.430
That's it!

00:05:59.430 --> 00:06:00.880
This thing is actually...

00:06:02.300 --> 00:06:03.960
Just an ordinary mammoth!

00:06:09.810 --> 00:06:10.930
Okay, then.

00:06:11.500 --> 00:06:12.810
Kotori!

00:06:15.170 --> 00:06:16.750
Kotori!

00:06:17.460 --> 00:06:18.580
Kotori—

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:27.190
Yeesh.

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:30.160
Hey.

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:31.360
Wake up, Kotori.

00:06:32.150 --> 00:06:33.200
Come on, already.

00:06:35.030 --> 00:06:36.220
Not gonna work, huh?

00:06:36.460 --> 00:06:37.580
If that's how it's gonna be...

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:42.730
Look, Kotori.

00:06:42.730 --> 00:06:45.210
Your beloved coins!

00:06:46.850 --> 00:06:47.500
Here.

00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:48.530
Take this!

00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:00.240
All right.

00:07:00.240 --> 00:07:01.930
This way, this way.

00:07:03.550 --> 00:07:06.610
Yeah, right this way!

00:07:09.800 --> 00:07:11.570
She's like a zombie.

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:14.320
Okay, this way...

00:07:20.260 --> 00:07:21.750
Kotarou-kun?

00:07:21.910 --> 00:07:23.090
Morning.

00:07:23.350 --> 00:07:24.620
Morning...

00:07:24.620 --> 00:07:25.910
Um...

00:07:26.730 --> 00:07:27.770
I'm home!

00:07:27.770 --> 00:07:28.520
It's nighttime!

00:07:28.520 --> 00:07:29.380
It's dark!

00:07:29.820 --> 00:07:32.190
You were asleep in the forest.

00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:36.050
Um, does that mean you brought 
me all the way here?

00:07:36.050 --> 00:07:36.890
Yeah.

00:07:37.050 --> 00:07:38.300
I see.

00:07:38.300 --> 00:07:40.290
Looks like I took up your time.

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:43.650
I was having this super-happy dream.

00:07:43.810 --> 00:07:44.520
What was it like?

00:07:45.020 --> 00:07:47.690
I was at the vending machine 
buying a drink, and then...

00:07:48.170 --> 00:07:51.850
...coins just kept pouring 
out of the change slot!

00:07:51.850 --> 00:07:53.530
Your happiness sure comes cheap.

00:07:54.650 --> 00:07:57.410
Anyway, your esteemed mother 
was worried about you.

00:07:57.660 --> 00:07:59.660
Why don't you head in?

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:02.540
Yeah, I will.

00:08:05.230 --> 00:08:06.180
Kotori...

00:08:09.870 --> 00:08:11.010
See you tomorrow.

00:08:12.130 --> 00:08:12.720
Yeah!

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:14.340
Good night!

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:17.640
Oh, and thanks for today.

00:08:19.020 --> 00:08:19.950
Sure.

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:22.790
Guess I'd better head back, too—

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:29.970
Was someone watching me just now?

00:08:33.970 --> 00:08:36.180
Something about tonight
 is giving me chills.

00:08:36.700 --> 00:08:38.780
The best option at times
 like these is to sleep!

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:39.640
Sleep!

00:08:39.640 --> 00:08:41.020
Go to sleep, Kotarou!

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:19.320
Wh-What the?!

00:09:22.050 --> 00:09:23.640
Was it a dream?

00:09:34.430 --> 00:09:36.060
<i>Sorry, Kotarou-kun.</i>

00:09:36.060 --> 00:09:37.730
<i>Go on without me again today.</i>

00:09:37.730 --> 00:09:39.340
<i>I'm running a little late.</i>

00:09:39.720 --> 00:09:40.810
Got it.

00:09:40.810 --> 00:09:42.230
I'll go on ahead, then.

00:09:42.230 --> 00:09:43.840
<i>Sorry about this.</i>

00:09:50.110 --> 00:09:52.070
It even left a mark.

00:09:54.490 --> 00:09:56.440
All right, let's go.

00:09:59.860 --> 00:10:02.490
<i>Kazamatsuri is a city focused 
on experimental afforestation.</i>

00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:06.630
<i>There are various research facilities,
corporations, and the like in the city</i>

00:10:06.630 --> 00:10:09.000
<i>which proactively tackle 
environmental problems.</i>

00:10:10.440 --> 00:10:11.500
<i>And in this peaceful,</i>

00:10:11.800 --> 00:10:12.630
<i>affluent,</i>

00:10:13.080 --> 00:10:14.820
<i>and blessed city,</i>

00:10:15.130 --> 00:10:17.280
<i>with greenery everywhere you go....</i>

00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:25.800
Let's enjoy our once-in-a-lifetime 
youth, Yoshino!

00:10:25.800 --> 00:10:28.420
In a way that'll make us forget
all about some bad dream!

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:31.290
Huh?

00:10:32.810 --> 00:10:35.620
<i>This guy with the wicked glare
first thing in the morning</i>

00:10:35.620 --> 00:10:38.550
<i>is who you could call the one
and only delinquent in our class,</i>

00:10:38.550 --> 00:10:40.270
<i>Yoshino Haruhiko.</i>

00:10:40.270 --> 00:10:43.950
<i>For some reason,
he can't stand the very sight of me.</i>

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:45.770
Ignoring me, huh?

00:10:45.770 --> 00:10:49.440
I'm gonna give him a piece of my 
Dead End Knuckle for sure.

00:10:49.440 --> 00:10:51.000
<i>And he's saying something alarming!</i>

00:10:51.150 --> 00:10:52.780
Hey, you jackass!

00:10:58.610 --> 00:10:59.740
You messin' with me?!

00:10:59.740 --> 00:11:00.470
Huh?!

00:11:01.720 --> 00:11:03.400
C-Calm down!

00:11:03.400 --> 00:11:05.970
Why are you so pissed today?

00:11:07.020 --> 00:11:08.880
Are you seriously saying that?!

00:11:08.880 --> 00:11:10.830
D-Did something happen?

00:11:11.290 --> 00:11:11.810
In that case,

00:11:12.220 --> 00:11:15.540
I'll use my fist to break open the door
your memories are locked behind!

00:11:15.540 --> 00:11:16.420
Wait!

00:11:16.420 --> 00:11:17.940
I'll open it up myself!

00:11:21.430 --> 00:11:23.570
Tennouji, I challenge you to a duel!

00:11:23.880 --> 00:11:25.140
Sorry, Yoshino.

00:11:25.140 --> 00:11:27.390
I don't know anything about
card games and stuff...

00:11:27.390 --> 00:11:29.080
I meant in the fighting sense!

00:11:30.640 --> 00:11:32.330
That's too bad, Yoshino.

00:11:32.660 --> 00:11:35.840
We built such a beautiful
 friendship as besties.

00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:37.460
How did we come to this?

00:11:38.410 --> 00:11:40.630
I don't recall ever being "besties" with you!

00:11:40.900 --> 00:11:43.890
And today, I'll beat that fact
into your very bones!

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:46.440
Sounds like you're serious.

00:11:46.440 --> 00:11:47.390
Got it.

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:48.260
I accept!

00:11:48.260 --> 00:11:50.680
After school, meet me behind 
the school building.

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:53.020
I'll give you a taste of 
"The End" right there!

00:11:53.170 --> 00:11:54.070
Okay.

00:11:54.070 --> 00:11:55.460
But just so you know,

00:11:55.460 --> 00:11:57.900
I'm not the sort of guy 
you'll end that easily.

00:11:58.170 --> 00:11:59.450
I wouldn't have it any other way.

00:11:59.450 --> 00:12:02.800
Don't you dare forget this 
fiery promise between men.

00:12:02.800 --> 00:12:04.450
Yeah, I know.

00:12:11.980 --> 00:12:13.170
Sorry, Yoshino.

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:15.040
I have a bad memory.

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:17.110
Oh, yeah?

00:12:17.110 --> 00:12:19.730
Then take your time remembering it
in the hospital!

00:12:19.730 --> 00:12:22.100
Knock it off, Tennouji Kotarou!

00:12:22.100 --> 00:12:23.580
Yoshino Haruhiko!

00:12:25.050 --> 00:12:29.220
If you don't stop causing a commotion
in this sacred garden of learning,

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:31.790
then I, your class representative,

00:12:31.790 --> 00:12:33.980
Konohana Lucia, won't stand idly by!

00:12:36.980 --> 00:12:39.180
Okay, Konohana-san.

00:12:41.940 --> 00:12:43.660
N-Nishikujou-sensei!

00:12:43.660 --> 00:12:44.610
When did you get here?

00:12:45.750 --> 00:12:48.450
The bell has already rung, you know.

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:48.990
Huh?

00:12:49.400 --> 00:12:51.650
So take your seats.

00:12:52.550 --> 00:12:53.540
Yes.

00:12:57.690 --> 00:13:00.750
Curse you, Tennouji!

00:13:05.290 --> 00:13:06.510
I won't forget this.

00:13:07.780 --> 00:13:09.590
Why always me?

00:13:19.770 --> 00:13:21.710
Oh, good morning, Kanbe-san.

00:13:21.710 --> 00:13:23.860
Oh, m-morning.

00:13:24.730 --> 00:13:25.680
Get this!

00:13:25.680 --> 00:13:27.630
After that, Aizawa-kun from Class E

00:13:27.630 --> 00:13:30.380
started going out with 
Tsukimiya-san from Class C!

00:13:30.380 --> 00:13:31.850
For real?!

00:13:32.400 --> 00:13:33.850
Hey, Tennouji.

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:37.470
I'll make anyone who looks down on me pay.

00:13:37.470 --> 00:13:38.870
Even if it happened to be

00:13:39.590 --> 00:13:41.040
God himself!

00:13:42.600 --> 00:13:45.490
"Even if it happened to be God himself?"

00:13:47.950 --> 00:13:49.050
I'll slaughter you!

00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:52.070
Prepare yourself!

00:13:52.070 --> 00:13:54.580
In ten minutes, I'll flatten you
and drown your rotten corpse

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:56.180
in a sea of blood!

00:13:56.440 --> 00:13:59.980
"In ten minutes, I'll flatten you
and drown your rotten corpse"?

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:05.460
You bastard!

00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:07.950
I don't know what to do with myself.

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:09.880
Even though I took an afternoon...

00:14:09.880 --> 00:14:12.430
no, evening nap in the forest yesterday,

00:14:12.430 --> 00:14:14.580
I totally overslept this morning.

00:14:15.170 --> 00:14:17.120
Fall really makes you fall asleep, huh?

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:19.420
By the way, what are you two talking about?

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:20.460
It seemed like fun!

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:22.210
Let me join in.

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:24.740
It has nothing to do with you.

00:14:24.740 --> 00:14:26.340
This is a matter between men.

00:14:26.580 --> 00:14:28.740
Talk about old-fashioned.

00:14:28.740 --> 00:14:31.150
That kind of thinking is really
behind the times, you know?

00:14:31.150 --> 00:14:31.780
She's right.

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:32.850
Knock off the bullying!

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:34.150
Screw you!

00:14:34.150 --> 00:14:37.490
I'm the victim here. We made a promise
between men and he stood me up!

00:14:37.490 --> 00:14:40.070
Quit making such a big deal
out of a promise to hang out!

00:14:40.070 --> 00:14:41.320
It was a duel!

00:14:41.320 --> 00:14:42.270
Good, good.

00:14:42.270 --> 00:14:44.170
You're like two bees in a pod.

00:14:44.170 --> 00:14:45.160
You mean "peas"...

00:14:45.160 --> 00:14:47.740
You're kidding me!
Who'd be friends with this jerk?

00:14:48.020 --> 00:14:50.460
I hear this sort of thing 
happens a lot lately.

00:14:50.460 --> 00:14:51.490
Hook up!

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:52.360
Shack up!

00:14:52.360 --> 00:14:53.650
Don't mess with me!

00:14:53.650 --> 00:14:54.850
That's totally gross!

00:14:54.850 --> 00:14:56.450
Lube up! Lube up!

00:14:56.450 --> 00:14:58.200
Stop it!

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:00.940
<i>Kotori doesn't have any friends.</i>

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:05.960
<i>Yoshino is also an outlaw in this classroom.</i>

00:15:06.470 --> 00:15:10.060
<i>Unlike these two,
I talk to everyone else a lot,</i>

00:15:10.060 --> 00:15:11.470
<i>but I don't exactly fit in myself.</i>

00:15:13.650 --> 00:15:14.590
<i>That's why...</i>

00:15:16.170 --> 00:15:16.820
Whoa!

00:15:16.820 --> 00:15:18.390
It's getting hot in here!

00:15:19.030 --> 00:15:21.230
Why are you on her side?!

00:15:22.140 --> 00:15:26.800
What if people start
 shipping Yoshi x Ten?!

00:15:27.080 --> 00:15:29.110
Yoshino, you sure know a lot about this.

00:15:31.270 --> 00:15:32.740
Leave me alone!

00:15:34.010 --> 00:15:35.330
<i>That's why I really feel</i>

00:15:35.610 --> 00:15:39.560
<i>we'd be able to have a lot of fun
if we hung out together as friends.</i>

00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:48.440
My body feels kinda heavy...

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:06.410
That ghost last night

00:16:06.410 --> 00:16:09.150
was the girl I saw in my dream 
the other day, wasn't she?

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:14.950
Did I do something to get myself cursed?

00:16:17.960 --> 00:16:21.350
Taking in the beauty of Mother Nature
 really puts me at ease.

00:16:25.800 --> 00:16:27.670
Why is there a cardboard box here?!

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:28.850
Ow!

00:16:28.850 --> 00:16:30.930
What's with this?!

00:16:30.930 --> 00:16:31.700
Huh?

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:36.950
Uh, are you all right?

00:16:37.580 --> 00:16:39.710
I am not all right!

00:16:39.710 --> 00:16:41.060
I can't move!

00:16:43.130 --> 00:16:45.840
O-Okay, I'll help you out,

00:16:45.840 --> 00:16:47.110
so hold on a sec.

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:49.040
What's wrong?

00:16:49.040 --> 00:16:51.190
I-If you look at my panties,
 I'll get mad!

00:16:51.390 --> 00:16:55.990
Uh, I wasn't planning to, but they're already
visible 'cause you're sitting up there.

00:16:59.130 --> 00:17:01.280
Please don't look, whatever you do!

00:17:01.280 --> 00:17:03.640
I kinda have to look up to help you.

00:17:03.640 --> 00:17:05.960
Help me <i>without</i> looking up!

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:09.330
I'm saved...

00:17:09.330 --> 00:17:12.120
How'd you end up there, anyway?

00:17:13.050 --> 00:17:14.420
Actually,

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:16.740
I may not look it,
but I'm a transfer student!

00:17:17.560 --> 00:17:20.260
I managed to make it this 
far somehow, but...

00:17:29.870 --> 00:17:31.940
I totally fell!

00:17:32.090 --> 00:17:33.070
Um...

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:35.430
W-Well, don't worry about it!

00:17:35.430 --> 00:17:37.230
These things happen!

00:17:37.750 --> 00:17:39.170
I feel so humiliated!

00:17:39.170 --> 00:17:41.020
A-Anyway, why don't we head to school?

00:17:43.050 --> 00:17:45.030
I just need to carry this for you, right?

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:46.120
There...

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:51.370
<i>I-It's heavy!</i>

00:17:51.370 --> 00:17:53.310
<i>Ridiculously heavy!</i>

00:17:58.370 --> 00:17:59.840
Is something the matter?

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:02.100
N-No, nothing at all.

00:18:02.100 --> 00:18:04.520
I just wasn't holding it right.

00:18:06.860 --> 00:18:09.850
Um, your face is beet red, 
your veins are bulging,

00:18:10.150 --> 00:18:12.550
and your arms are trembling.

00:18:12.550 --> 00:18:14.110
I'll carry it.

00:18:14.110 --> 00:18:15.600
I'm strong!

00:18:15.600 --> 00:18:16.310
No!

00:18:16.310 --> 00:18:19.490
That would hurt my pride as a man!

00:18:19.710 --> 00:18:23.770
But I don't want you dropping it,
so I think I'll carry it after all.

00:18:23.770 --> 00:18:26.220
Please, milady, have mercy!
 Give me one last chance!

00:18:26.220 --> 00:18:27.960
Jeez, what's with you?

00:18:27.960 --> 00:18:29.370
Please let go!

00:18:36.870 --> 00:18:38.380
Ow!

00:18:38.380 --> 00:18:40.470
What was that for?

00:18:40.470 --> 00:18:42.100
S-Sorry.

00:18:43.370 --> 00:18:44.600
Is something wrong?

00:18:45.460 --> 00:18:46.970
I was right. Those <i>are</i> cherries.

00:18:47.170 --> 00:18:47.980
Huh?

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:51.570
Wh-What do you mean, "I was right"?

00:18:52.720 --> 00:18:54.230
So you <i>did</i> see them before!

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:57.340
I told you, I couldn't help 
you without looking up.

00:18:59.010 --> 00:19:06.160
<b>Meowers and Packers</b>

00:19:00.350 --> 00:19:03.180
Thank you <i>so</i> very much for saving me!

00:19:03.180 --> 00:19:07.040
But I hate you regardless!

00:19:11.570 --> 00:19:15.530
Well, no biggie. It's not like we know
for sure that she'll join my class.

00:19:19.220 --> 00:19:21.110
Ohtori-san, please introduce yourself.

00:19:21.110 --> 00:19:23.790
I-I'm Ohtori Chihaya.
 I just transferred here.

00:19:23.790 --> 00:19:25.470
P-Pleased to meet you!

00:19:32.050 --> 00:19:36.730
Her uniform isn't ready yet, so she'll be
coming to school like this for now.

00:19:36.970 --> 00:19:40.770
Like most transfer students, you'll be sitting
in the last row, beside Tennouji-kun.

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:42.110
Ugh.

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:42.110
Ugh.

00:19:42.270 --> 00:19:43.200
Ugh?

00:19:44.650 --> 00:19:46.050
Over here, right?

00:19:47.140 --> 00:19:48.170
Okay,

00:19:48.170 --> 00:19:51.730
I have a message for all of you regarding 
next month's harvest festa,

00:19:51.730 --> 00:19:54.860
so please pass these handouts 
along to the person behind you!

00:19:58.960 --> 00:20:00.550
Hey, Cherr—

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:11.570
If you want to take part in any
part-time work or extracurricular activities,

00:20:11.570 --> 00:20:14.320
be sure to submit an application in advance.

00:20:14.560 --> 00:20:17.030
It's also recommended you do 
extracurricular activities

00:20:14.790 --> 00:20:15.880
Oh, no,

00:20:15.880 --> 00:20:17.570
I, Tennouji Kotarou,

00:20:17.030 --> 00:20:19.220
such as volunteering for the 
duration of the festival.

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:19.820
sometimes get cherry confused,
so please keep that in mind.

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:22.340
We'll be going on break for a week,

00:20:22.340 --> 00:20:24.440
but these are extracurricular 
lessons in a way,

00:20:23.880 --> 00:20:26.150
Pleased to meet you,
 for what it's worth.

00:20:24.440 --> 00:20:26.890
so be sure not to slack off too much.

00:20:26.150 --> 00:20:29.150
But I still hate you.

00:20:27.210 --> 00:20:30.200
Now, carrying on...

00:20:51.350 --> 00:20:53.650
Let me see that for a second, young lady.

00:21:03.830 --> 00:21:05.900
Keeping a whistle clean is a good thing,

00:21:05.900 --> 00:21:09.300
but it won't work if it's waterlogged.

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:13.430
You washed this before you 
used it, too, didn't you?

00:21:13.840 --> 00:21:14.600
Here.

00:21:20.020 --> 00:21:21.610
Impressive as always, Kotarou.

00:21:21.610 --> 00:21:22.600
Many thanks!

00:21:27.290 --> 00:21:28.430
Warning.

00:21:28.430 --> 00:21:30.230
You mustn't run in the hall.

00:21:30.230 --> 00:21:32.450
Did I just go from savior to offender?

00:21:32.450 --> 00:21:34.450
I'm part of the Disciplay Committee.

00:21:34.450 --> 00:21:36.130
You mean "Disciplinary."

00:21:36.130 --> 00:21:37.020
That's it!

00:21:37.290 --> 00:21:41.480
<i>This Nakatsu Shizuru girl who I happened
to run into at some meeting before</i>

00:21:41.480 --> 00:21:46.200
<i>is a cheerful underclassman who
occasionally messes with me like this.</i>

00:21:47.170 --> 00:21:49.820
So, what happens when 
I receive a warning?

00:21:49.820 --> 00:21:51.530
You get punished 
according to regulations.

00:21:52.500 --> 00:21:54.480
The regulations don't say anything about it!

00:21:54.820 --> 00:21:58.510
Since you're in the Disciplinary Committee,
why don't you deliver my sentence?

00:22:02.540 --> 00:22:05.300
Let's eat lunch in the courtyard together.

00:22:06.170 --> 00:22:10.300
Wait, did you do all this
just to ask me to eat with you?

00:22:13.050 --> 00:22:14.810
But I'm sorry.

00:22:14.810 --> 00:22:17.270
I've already finished my lunch for today.

00:22:17.520 --> 00:22:18.930
I see.

00:22:18.930 --> 00:22:19.940
Another day, okay?

00:22:21.390 --> 00:22:23.440
Okay, Kotarou, it's a promise.

00:22:24.720 --> 00:22:25.750
You got it.

00:22:26.230 --> 00:22:27.220
See ya!

00:22:27.860 --> 00:22:31.450
Ensnaring a Disciplinary Committee member
and covering up his crimes...

00:22:31.640 --> 00:22:33.620
What are you jotting down?
That's slander!

00:22:34.050 --> 00:22:36.790
I'm Inoue, from the newspaper club.

00:22:36.790 --> 00:22:37.960
The newspaper club?

00:22:37.960 --> 00:22:39.670
I've never seen any school newspapers.

00:22:39.670 --> 00:22:41.220
That's because it's an online newspaper.

00:22:41.220 --> 00:22:43.840
So, what does a newspaper club
member want from me?

00:22:43.990 --> 00:22:46.840
Tennouji-kun, is it true you 
bought your way into our school?

00:22:47.010 --> 00:22:49.090
Cutting right to the chase, are we?

00:22:49.270 --> 00:22:51.850
I've never heard that
 ridiculous rumor before.

00:22:51.850 --> 00:22:54.150
"He vehemently refutes
the accusations, as is usual."

00:22:54.150 --> 00:22:56.090
Why do I feel malice
oozing out of your words?

00:22:56.090 --> 00:22:57.700
I got in on merit.

00:22:57.700 --> 00:22:59.100
Double-check your facts!

00:22:59.100 --> 00:23:01.400
"It's all been covered up perfectly"...

00:23:02.180 --> 00:23:04.460
T-Talk about a twisted personality.

00:23:04.460 --> 00:23:06.850
This is the true spirit of journalism!

00:23:07.390 --> 00:23:09.140
Try and dig up dirt on me all you want.

00:23:09.140 --> 00:23:11.490
I'm totally spotless!

00:23:12.230 --> 00:23:13.930
I'll do just that.

00:23:14.310 --> 00:23:17.720
I'll treat you to some interrogation-room
katsudon before long!

00:23:20.140 --> 00:23:21.600
What was that all about?

00:23:26.340 --> 00:23:28.340
Inoue's Scoop Notes

00:23:29.060 --> 00:23:30.840
She's a seriously dangerous person.

00:23:30.840 --> 00:23:33.340
3rd Year (Witch) Senri Akane: President of the occult research club 
Possesses authority far beyond that of a mere student
Extremely dangerous to make contact with (Plan carefully!)

00:23:30.840 --> 00:23:33.340
2nd Year (Messiah) Tanuma Imako
Suspected to be the messiah
Under gag order?
Consider interviewing medical personnel

00:23:30.840 --> 00:23:33.340
1st Year (Scissor Girl) Shinsaibashi Hitomi
Possibly repeating the school year
Possesses great athletic ability but refused to join any sports clubs
-> 9/1 Transferred (No explanation why)

00:23:34.350 --> 00:23:36.430
2nd Year (Ashen Boy) Tennouji Kotarou

00:23:36.430 --> 00:23:37.850
2nd Year (Ashen Boy) Tennouji Kotarou
Lots of irregularities in his history,
like he has no background at all?
Direct interview potentially possible.

00:23:38.240 --> 00:23:40.840
<i>She really </i>might<i> be dangerous...</i>

00:23:41.660 --> 00:23:43.390
Okay, then, Kotarou-kun.

00:23:43.390 --> 00:23:46.100
I have a Spread the Green Committee meeting,

00:23:46.100 --> 00:23:47.350
so I'll see you tomorrow.

00:23:48.630 --> 00:23:50.220
How enthusiastic.

00:23:50.220 --> 00:23:51.650
Well, good luck.

00:23:52.690 --> 00:23:54.030
Hey, Ohtori.

00:23:54.560 --> 00:23:55.810
Wh-What is it?

00:23:55.810 --> 00:23:57.620
Please don't speak to me out of nowhere!

00:23:57.840 --> 00:24:00.170
If you don't have any plans after this,

00:24:00.170 --> 00:24:02.620
why don't I show you around town?

00:24:02.780 --> 00:24:04.120
H-Huh?

00:24:04.120 --> 00:24:05.380
Why would you do that?

00:24:05.600 --> 00:24:08.010
We've unfortunately had some disagreements,

00:24:08.010 --> 00:24:10.550
but I bear you no ill will.

00:24:10.810 --> 00:24:13.190
Anyway, it's my way of making it up to you

00:24:13.190 --> 00:24:14.390
and saying sorry.

00:24:14.840 --> 00:24:19.800
Wh-When you put it that way,
I have to say I'm sorry, too.

00:24:19.800 --> 00:24:23.390
But I hate your big mouth regardless!

00:24:23.390 --> 00:24:26.200
Oh, I'll make sure not to say 
anything about your cherry—

00:24:26.400 --> 00:24:29.650
A-Anyway, I have plans to meet up 
with someone I know today,

00:24:29.650 --> 00:24:31.600
so I can't go with you!

00:24:31.600 --> 00:24:32.780
Goodbye!

00:24:33.240 --> 00:24:34.660
See you tomorrow!

00:24:35.960 --> 00:24:38.140
She just transferred here,
and she knows someone already?

00:24:44.640 --> 00:24:45.920
It's been a while.

00:24:48.940 --> 00:24:51.070
You did well to make it here alone.

00:24:51.390 --> 00:24:53.670
Why are you treating me like a kid?

00:24:53.930 --> 00:24:57.680
What's important is what comes next,
so make sure you don't stand out too much.

00:24:58.860 --> 00:24:59.680
Yes...

00:24:59.950 --> 00:25:02.660
By the way, does it look like
you'll be able to make any friends?

00:25:02.660 --> 00:25:04.560
Friends?

00:25:05.790 --> 00:25:07.560
Is it okay for me to make friends?

00:25:07.770 --> 00:25:09.870
Why not? It shouldn't be a problem.

00:25:16.100 --> 00:25:18.320
Close encounters of the supernatural
 kind night after night?

00:25:18.460 --> 00:25:20.830
I wonder if the witch could 
do something about it?

00:25:21.060 --> 00:25:22.050
Witch?

00:25:22.050 --> 00:25:23.380
Didn't you know?

00:25:23.380 --> 00:25:26.200
She's kind of an underground
 celebrity in this academy.

00:25:26.200 --> 00:25:27.740
They call her the Underworld Don,

00:25:27.740 --> 00:25:29.990
the Academy Witch, and stuff.

00:25:29.990 --> 00:25:31.740
Sounds kinda fishy.

00:25:31.740 --> 00:25:34.740
Apparently she has a command over
magic, superpowers, curses, spirits,

00:25:34.740 --> 00:25:36.680
and all sorts of things.

00:25:36.680 --> 00:25:38.010
That's a lot of fingers in a lot of pies.

00:25:38.330 --> 00:25:41.780
She rarely shows up for class, but no matter
how much time she takes off,

00:25:41.780 --> 00:25:46.140
she's never held back or expelled,
and always advances to the next grade.

00:25:46.140 --> 00:25:47.030
So mysterious!

00:25:47.030 --> 00:25:49.470
How could a student have 
that sort of influence?

00:25:49.470 --> 00:25:51.360
It's not like this is some manga.

00:25:54.530 --> 00:25:55.610
What is that?

00:25:55.610 --> 00:25:57.610
3rd Year (Witch) Senri Akane: President of the occult research club 
Possesses authority far beyond that of a mere student
Extremely dangerous to make contact with (Plan carefully!)

00:25:57.610 --> 00:26:00.650
"Third year (Witch) Senri Akane:

00:26:00.650 --> 00:26:02.940
President of the occult research club.

00:26:02.940 --> 00:26:07.620
Possesses authority far beyond
 that of a mere student," huh?

00:26:07.850 --> 00:26:08.870
Say,

00:26:09.200 --> 00:26:11.780
want to go look for this witch?

00:26:14.200 --> 00:26:17.650
It's not often that you
 suggest something like that.

00:26:17.650 --> 00:26:18.380
Are you in love?

00:26:18.700 --> 00:26:21.510
What, with someone 
whose face I don't even know?

00:26:21.510 --> 00:26:23.680
Desperate times call for
desperate measures, is all.

00:26:23.680 --> 00:26:24.370
Okay.

00:26:24.370 --> 00:26:25.020
Huh?

00:26:25.480 --> 00:26:26.340
Okay.

00:26:26.340 --> 00:26:27.180
Let's look for her.

00:26:27.400 --> 00:26:29.410
If you think it's a good idea,

00:26:29.410 --> 00:26:30.960
then I think we should do it.

00:26:30.960 --> 00:26:34.190
Besides, you might just end up
meeting someone special.

00:26:41.480 --> 00:26:42.450
Thanks.

00:26:54.100 --> 00:26:54.970
What's the plan?

00:26:54.970 --> 00:26:56.110
Do we head out right away?

00:26:56.110 --> 00:26:58.270
No, it'd be lonely if it 
was just the two of us.

00:26:58.270 --> 00:27:00.900
We might be mistaken for a couple, too.

00:27:01.350 --> 00:27:03.050
What's wrong with that?

00:27:03.520 --> 00:27:05.350
No debauchery. Let's keep it PG.

00:27:05.510 --> 00:27:06.430
That so?

00:27:06.430 --> 00:27:07.540
<i>How cold.</i>

00:27:07.540 --> 00:27:09.350
Let's hire a mercenary, then!

00:27:10.110 --> 00:27:11.050
Yoshino...

00:27:11.890 --> 00:27:13.860
Let's go on the adventure of our dreams!

00:27:14.500 --> 00:27:15.800
I'll kill you.

00:27:18.140 --> 00:27:21.040
And so, the two of them set off on
the adventure of their dreams alone.

00:27:21.040 --> 00:27:23.030
How are we going to search for the witch?

00:27:23.270 --> 00:27:25.580
We'll just have to ask everyone, 
from top to bottom.

00:27:25.580 --> 00:27:27.040
That's what I thought.

00:27:42.960 --> 00:27:44.300
She's nowhere to be found!

00:27:44.570 --> 00:27:46.780
Maybe she's hiding using magic or something.

00:27:46.780 --> 00:27:49.050
If that's true, then it's all over.

00:27:49.870 --> 00:27:51.530
I've heard the whole story!

00:27:51.530 --> 00:27:53.520
Y-You're, um...

00:27:53.520 --> 00:27:56.140
The so-called information broker in class...

00:27:56.140 --> 00:27:56.880
Yamada-kun!

00:27:56.880 --> 00:27:58.170
It's Suzuki!

00:27:58.170 --> 00:28:00.960
That aside, how could you 
be so distant, Tennouji-kun?

00:28:00.960 --> 00:28:02.950
Now, take this.

00:28:02.950 --> 00:28:05.320
Kazamatsuri High 
Occult Research Club

00:28:03.110 --> 00:28:05.320
Is this an occult club report?

00:28:06.000 --> 00:28:10.140
Said to have been published in secret and
passed down among students for generations,

00:28:10.140 --> 00:28:12.060
this is loot with a storied history.

00:28:12.510 --> 00:28:14.540
I hope it proves useful in your quest.

00:28:14.880 --> 00:28:16.090
Yeah, it's plenty!

00:28:16.680 --> 00:28:17.770
Thanks, Satou!

00:28:17.770 --> 00:28:20.200
Yeah, but it's Suzuki, Tennouji-kun!

00:28:21.350 --> 00:28:22.970
Lovey-dovey?

00:28:22.970 --> 00:28:24.430
Not even close.

00:28:27.260 --> 00:28:29.240
Based on the report we got from Tanaka,

00:28:29.240 --> 00:28:30.140
this is the place.

00:28:30.140 --> 00:28:31.640
You mean Suzuki-kun.

00:28:35.430 --> 00:28:37.150
Please excuse us!

00:28:37.750 --> 00:28:38.780
It's dark!

00:28:38.780 --> 00:28:39.900
Um...

00:28:39.900 --> 00:28:41.570
Let's turn on the lights...

00:28:45.740 --> 00:28:47.740
Hey, is somebody here?!

00:28:47.880 --> 00:28:51.250
I think that switch was around here...

00:28:51.250 --> 00:28:55.210
<i>The House of Wax!</i>

00:28:55.210 --> 00:29:00.250
<i>The House of Wax!</i>

00:28:58.510 --> 00:29:00.250
What a pointless gimmick.

00:29:05.090 --> 00:29:06.220
What the heck is this?!

00:29:06.500 --> 00:29:09.040
You can hardly call these school facilities!

00:29:11.430 --> 00:29:13.640
Maybe we have the wrong place?

00:29:13.640 --> 00:29:17.350
No, all the books on the shelf 
are related to the occult.

00:29:17.570 --> 00:29:18.610
What should we do?

00:29:18.610 --> 00:29:20.510
It doesn't seem like anyone is here.

00:29:20.510 --> 00:29:22.090
It's evening already,

00:29:22.090 --> 00:29:23.920
so it's possible nobody will show up today.

00:29:23.920 --> 00:29:25.520
Want to leave a note?

00:29:25.520 --> 00:29:26.740
Good idea.

00:29:26.740 --> 00:29:28.740
I'm looking for the witch to discuss
something occult related. Please get in touch.
2-B Tennouji Kotarou

00:29:41.820 --> 00:29:43.640
Damn, it won't turn on!

00:29:44.740 --> 00:29:46.920
Darkness makes evil stronger!

00:29:47.730 --> 00:29:49.140
I gotta get out of this room!

00:29:49.140 --> 00:29:51.110
Wait, it won't open?!

00:29:52.990 --> 00:29:54.060
Th-Theranden!

00:29:54.060 --> 00:29:55.680
TL Note: Theranden means "The veranda, then."

00:29:59.620 --> 00:30:01.020
I have no choice!

00:30:03.730 --> 00:30:04.820
Damn it!

00:30:08.360 --> 00:30:09.870
A spirit field?!

00:30:33.300 --> 00:30:34.300
Crap!

00:30:34.300 --> 00:30:35.350
Open!

00:30:35.800 --> 00:30:37.940
S-Someone!

00:30:38.160 --> 00:30:39.270
Help me!

00:30:39.270 --> 00:30:41.440
Help me! Kotori!

00:30:41.740 --> 00:30:43.820
Kotori...

00:30:48.010 --> 00:30:48.570
Huh?

00:30:53.670 --> 00:30:57.410
I guess I have quite the powerful sixth sense...

00:30:59.440 --> 00:31:01.080
Excuse me.

00:31:01.830 --> 00:31:03.530
Nobody home, huh?

00:31:04.190 --> 00:31:07.210
I hope they at least saw the note.

00:31:09.090 --> 00:31:10.840
<b>You will die in two days.</b>

00:31:16.440 --> 00:31:17.600
It's addressed to me.

00:31:18.300 --> 00:31:20.600
A questionnaire?

00:31:22.140 --> 00:31:25.220
I don't see the point of
most of these questions.

00:31:25.980 --> 00:31:27.150
(1)The World (2) Myself

00:31:25.980 --> 00:31:30.490
Q25) You have power, and are discontent with this world. Tell me, 
do you wish to change this world? Or do you wish to change yourself?

00:31:30.490 --> 00:31:32.240
<b>(1) The World                          (2) Myself</b>

00:31:32.380 --> 00:31:34.190
What is this, a zen riddle?

00:31:38.060 --> 00:31:39.400
<i>If I were to change something,</i>

00:31:39.400 --> 00:31:41.250
<i>would it be the world or myself?</i>

00:31:42.300 --> 00:31:43.320
<i>I...</i>

00:31:49.100 --> 00:31:50.760
Wanna drop by the arcade on the way home?

00:31:50.980 --> 00:31:51.750
Yeah!

00:31:51.750 --> 00:31:53.580
Wanna settle the score from the other day?

00:31:53.580 --> 00:31:55.460
Let's grab a bite to eat first.

00:31:55.460 --> 00:31:57.300
I'm so hungry I could die!

00:31:57.300 --> 00:31:58.300
Kotarou!

00:31:59.020 --> 00:31:59.850
Huh?

00:32:03.270 --> 00:32:06.270
Wh-What is it, Ohtori-san?

00:32:06.450 --> 00:32:09.280
Uh, why the pause?

00:32:09.450 --> 00:32:12.340
Well, you did just call me by 
my first name all of a sudden.

00:32:12.340 --> 00:32:13.190
Uh...

00:32:13.190 --> 00:32:14.610
So, what is it?

00:32:14.610 --> 00:32:18.290
U-Um, about what you said the other day...

00:32:18.560 --> 00:32:19.730
The other day?

00:32:19.730 --> 00:32:20.660
What was that?

00:32:21.090 --> 00:32:22.660
See you, Kota-san.

00:32:23.020 --> 00:32:23.730
Yeah.

00:32:23.730 --> 00:32:26.930
Spread the Green Committee
activities again today?

00:32:26.930 --> 00:32:27.900
Good luck.

00:32:30.020 --> 00:32:32.240
Looks like she wants to
 say bye to you, Kotori.

00:32:33.120 --> 00:32:35.300
You don't need to provide
running commentary!

00:32:35.640 --> 00:32:36.720
I see.

00:32:37.260 --> 00:32:38.810
Ohtori-san, see you later.

00:32:39.590 --> 00:32:40.810
Y-Yes!

00:32:41.240 --> 00:32:42.810
Goodbye, Kotori-san!

00:32:44.080 --> 00:32:45.710
Come on, Kotori-san.

00:32:45.710 --> 00:32:48.810
What are you supposed to do when someone
addresses you by your first name?

00:32:48.810 --> 00:32:50.460
O-Oh, right...

00:32:51.000 --> 00:32:52.860
Um, Chihaya-san.

00:32:53.060 --> 00:32:53.860
Yes!

00:32:54.040 --> 00:32:55.540
Then, Chi-chan!

00:32:55.850 --> 00:32:56.750
Yes?

00:32:59.620 --> 00:33:00.660
Oh, right.

00:33:01.060 --> 00:33:04.620
Kotarou-kun, why don't you 
show Chi-chan around town?

00:33:05.070 --> 00:33:06.430
Oh, that's right!

00:33:06.430 --> 00:33:08.860
You did mention that
the other day, Kotarou.

00:33:08.860 --> 00:33:11.660
Since you offered,
I don't mind going with you.

00:33:11.660 --> 00:33:12.670
Oh.

00:33:12.670 --> 00:33:15.640
Yeah, I did say something like that.

00:33:17.340 --> 00:33:18.860
By the way, Kotarou-san.

00:33:18.860 --> 00:33:19.670
Yes?

00:33:19.670 --> 00:33:21.620
She's calling you "Kotarou"?

00:33:22.520 --> 00:33:24.190
What about it?

00:33:26.160 --> 00:33:28.370
You two should go together, then.

00:33:28.700 --> 00:33:29.800
See you, Chi-chan!

00:33:29.800 --> 00:33:31.340
Oh, sure.

00:33:31.340 --> 00:33:32.720
Goodbye!

00:33:35.800 --> 00:33:37.410
Hey, what's that for?!

00:33:47.060 --> 00:33:49.170
Aren't you coming, Ohtori-san?

00:33:50.980 --> 00:33:52.430
I-I am!

00:34:06.090 --> 00:34:07.560
Say, Ohtori.

00:34:08.280 --> 00:34:10.690
Why did you move here at this time of year?

00:34:11.210 --> 00:34:12.420
Maybe...

00:34:12.950 --> 00:34:15.690
Because it was the perfect 
time of year to do so?

00:34:15.690 --> 00:34:16.700
Huh?

00:34:16.700 --> 00:34:18.350
Summer is hot,

00:34:18.350 --> 00:34:20.010
and winter is cold.

00:34:20.510 --> 00:34:22.470
What a dubious reason!

00:34:35.560 --> 00:34:36.990
If I'm showing you around town,

00:34:36.990 --> 00:34:38.430
I can't leave this place out.

00:34:40.860 --> 00:34:43.680
The Martel Group's
Japanese headquarters, right?

00:34:43.910 --> 00:34:45.930
Oh, you knew about it?

00:34:45.930 --> 00:34:47.230
I mean,

00:34:47.230 --> 00:34:51.590
it <i>is</i> a famous worldwide environmental group.

00:34:53.700 --> 00:34:54.940
What next?

00:34:55.320 --> 00:34:56.900
Well...

00:34:56.900 --> 00:35:00.240
I'm hungry, so I was thinking 
of heading home for the day.

00:35:00.240 --> 00:35:03.060
Yeah, the sun does look like 
it's going to set soon.

00:35:04.040 --> 00:35:07.200
Um, thank you very much for today.

00:35:07.200 --> 00:35:08.980
It was kind of fun.

00:35:08.980 --> 00:35:10.550
Glad to hear it.

00:35:10.780 --> 00:35:11.920
Take care on your way home.

00:35:12.500 --> 00:35:13.580
Okay, then.

00:35:13.580 --> 00:35:15.420
See you at school tomorrow...

00:35:25.850 --> 00:35:27.850
To K.T. Tonight at midnight, come 
to classroom 2-A alone.
Refer to the map below
 for your entry route.

00:35:27.850 --> 00:35:29.850
From the Academy Witch

00:35:39.830 --> 00:35:42.740
Being in the school at night
really gets one's blood pumping.

00:35:44.920 --> 00:35:46.240
Hello?

00:35:46.240 --> 00:35:48.150
Wait, nobody's here?

00:35:49.000 --> 00:35:51.250
<b>To K.T. Go to 1-C.</b>

00:35:49.540 --> 00:35:50.510
I see.

00:35:50.510 --> 00:35:52.210
So that's the idea!

00:35:55.000 --> 00:35:56.000
<b>To K.T. Go to classroom 3-B.</b>

00:35:56.090 --> 00:35:57.250
<b>To K.T. Go to classroom 2-D.</b>

00:35:57.300 --> 00:35:58.510
<b>To K.T. Go to the library.</b>

00:35:58.510 --> 00:36:00.510
<b>To K.T. Go to the connecting hallway.</b>

00:36:07.270 --> 00:36:08.740
I don't mind playing the game,

00:36:08.740 --> 00:36:11.140
but the witch is making me
run around too much.

00:36:20.310 --> 00:36:21.780
Was it my imagination?

00:37:02.940 --> 00:37:03.610
What the hell?

00:37:03.980 --> 00:37:05.600
What the hell is this?

00:37:07.790 --> 00:37:09.730
What the hell is she?!

00:37:11.650 --> 00:37:12.410
Hang on.

00:37:12.620 --> 00:37:15.420
Was this hallway always this long?

00:37:20.120 --> 00:37:20.960
In that case!

00:37:22.510 --> 00:37:23.380
Damn!

00:37:23.380 --> 00:37:24.540
Open!

00:37:28.030 --> 00:37:28.970
Open up!

00:37:31.420 --> 00:37:32.790
Is someone there?!

00:37:54.800 --> 00:37:57.000
What in the world were those things?

00:38:03.170 --> 00:38:04.460
This is insane.

00:38:04.820 --> 00:38:06.290
Or maybe not.

00:38:07.060 --> 00:38:09.250
If superpowers exist,

00:38:09.680 --> 00:38:11.540
then it wouldn't be strange 
if ghosts and UMAs existed,

00:38:11.540 --> 00:38:14.220
or if supernatural phenomena
 were to occur.

00:38:15.360 --> 00:38:16.580
Either way,

00:38:16.580 --> 00:38:18.250
I need to find a way out of here

00:38:18.250 --> 00:38:20.780
before I can think about meeting the witch.

00:38:48.340 --> 00:38:49.190
Damn it!

00:38:49.190 --> 00:38:50.090
Damn it!

00:38:50.300 --> 00:38:53.010
How long is she going to chase me?!

00:38:56.560 --> 00:38:57.960
Ow...

00:38:59.740 --> 00:39:00.610
Huh?

00:39:04.410 --> 00:39:06.230
What is this?

00:39:08.010 --> 00:39:08.490
Hey!

00:39:09.150 --> 00:39:10.070
Are you serious?!

00:39:10.070 --> 00:39:11.480
Hey! Hey!

00:39:11.480 --> 00:39:12.730
Damn it!

00:39:16.340 --> 00:39:18.170
What should I do?

00:39:21.590 --> 00:39:24.260
Give it to me...

00:39:24.260 --> 00:39:26.460
Damn, another supernatural phenomenon?

00:39:27.330 --> 00:39:29.220
<i>Should I hit the accelerator?</i>

00:39:34.220 --> 00:39:35.350
I won't make it in time!

00:39:35.350 --> 00:39:38.510
Give me your blood!

00:39:44.720 --> 00:39:46.730
Curse you!

00:39:46.930 --> 00:39:48.260
What is this thing?

00:39:48.260 --> 00:39:49.260
A plant?

00:39:49.260 --> 00:39:50.480
No, an insect?

00:39:50.480 --> 00:39:51.610
And it talks...

00:39:53.000 --> 00:39:54.490
It hurts so bad!

00:39:54.690 --> 00:39:56.160
Hey, are you all right?

00:39:56.700 --> 00:39:57.990
It was a feint!

00:39:57.990 --> 00:40:00.430
Your blood is mine!

00:40:00.430 --> 00:40:02.670
You idiot!

00:40:02.840 --> 00:40:05.000
What are you trying to pull?

00:40:05.360 --> 00:40:08.600
We're not allowed to let humans see us,

00:40:08.600 --> 00:40:12.130
and here you're <i>attacking</i> one?

00:40:12.800 --> 00:40:14.510
Now there's another one.

00:40:15.140 --> 00:40:16.300
Salutations.

00:40:16.300 --> 00:40:18.010
My name is Pani.

00:40:18.010 --> 00:40:18.790
Huh?

00:40:18.790 --> 00:40:20.780
Oh, my regards.

00:40:20.780 --> 00:40:22.570
I am Tennouji Kotarou.

00:40:22.570 --> 00:40:25.210
My! What a polite, nice guy!

00:40:25.210 --> 00:40:27.620
And yet Gil-chan here is so rude!

00:40:27.620 --> 00:40:30.470
But the air was filled with
 the delectable aroma of blood.

00:40:30.470 --> 00:40:33.570
I couldn't resist the urge.

00:40:33.570 --> 00:40:35.370
Looks like I scraped myself somewhere.

00:40:35.370 --> 00:40:37.850
So, you're Pani and Gil?

00:40:38.030 --> 00:40:39.970
Do you two have to suck blood to live?

00:40:39.970 --> 00:40:42.540
That's just Gil-chan's hobby.

00:40:42.540 --> 00:40:44.750
We can survive on water and light.

00:40:44.750 --> 00:40:46.550
You're almost like plants.

00:40:46.940 --> 00:40:49.130
Give me blood...

00:40:49.130 --> 00:40:50.550
Jeez, fine.

00:40:50.550 --> 00:40:51.350
Blood...

00:40:51.350 --> 00:40:52.400
Blood...

00:40:52.400 --> 00:40:53.240
Here.

00:40:55.920 --> 00:40:57.890
Yummy blood!

00:41:00.720 --> 00:41:02.490
Get your mouth off my finger!

00:41:04.150 --> 00:41:05.540
I'll lick it all up!

00:41:05.540 --> 00:41:08.000
Get off of me!

00:41:09.130 --> 00:41:11.730
Wow, you're a super-nice guy!

00:41:11.730 --> 00:41:12.320
All right!

00:41:12.320 --> 00:41:15.290
With this, you and I have formed a contract!

00:41:15.290 --> 00:41:16.750
Let's have a good time!

00:41:16.750 --> 00:41:17.340
Huh?

00:41:17.340 --> 00:41:18.580
I want no part of it.

00:41:18.580 --> 00:41:19.700
Shot down?!

00:41:20.000 --> 00:41:21.430
Heck, this is a little late,

00:41:21.430 --> 00:41:23.170
but what are you two, exactly?

00:41:23.170 --> 00:41:26.510
We were born from dumped garbage.

00:41:26.510 --> 00:41:27.360
Garbage?

00:41:27.360 --> 00:41:28.460
Yes, garbage.

00:41:29.050 --> 00:41:33.000
By the way, why is the atmosphere
getting worse by the second?

00:41:33.000 --> 00:41:35.140
Do you really know where the exit is?

00:41:35.140 --> 00:41:35.720
Ack!

00:41:36.320 --> 00:41:37.860
O-O-Of course!

00:41:37.860 --> 00:41:39.850
We're not lost or anything!

00:41:40.180 --> 00:41:42.510
Guess this is what you call
letting the cat out of the bag.

00:41:42.740 --> 00:41:43.450
Jeez!

00:41:43.450 --> 00:41:46.480
We followed you because you said 
we could count on you, Gil-chan!

00:41:46.920 --> 00:41:50.380
This kind of looks like the sort of 
place the final boss would show up.

00:41:53.010 --> 00:41:54.470
What was that just now?

00:41:54.470 --> 00:41:55.630
This is bad.

00:41:55.630 --> 00:41:58.860
We got lost and wandered 
right into its nest!

00:41:58.860 --> 00:42:00.990
H-Hey, what is "it" supposed to be?

00:42:09.140 --> 00:42:11.250
What <i>is</i> that?

00:42:14.090 --> 00:42:15.740
<i>I have to hit the accelerator this time...</i>

00:42:15.740 --> 00:42:16.780
<i>No, I can't.</i>

00:42:16.780 --> 00:42:20.260
<i>I bet that won't be nearly enough
to handle this thing!</i>

00:42:20.600 --> 00:42:21.520
Don't worry.

00:42:21.520 --> 00:42:23.310
It's still asleep.

00:42:23.310 --> 00:42:25.370
Let's leave this place,
and be careful not to wake it.

00:42:25.370 --> 00:42:28.600
Y-You two, be quiet.

00:42:29.550 --> 00:42:32.900
Make <i>sure</i> you don't make any loud noises!

00:42:33.320 --> 00:42:34.000
Got it?

00:42:34.000 --> 00:42:36.250
Be absolutely sure...

00:42:41.690 --> 00:42:44.540
Gil-chan!

00:42:44.670 --> 00:42:47.790
I'm sorry!

00:42:54.150 --> 00:42:55.450
We're done for!

00:42:56.270 --> 00:42:57.260
We're gonna die!

00:43:08.260 --> 00:43:09.570
<i>Not good, not good!</i>

00:43:09.570 --> 00:43:11.980
<i>I'll get smashed to bits 
if it lands a single hit!</i>

00:43:33.850 --> 00:43:36.290
You chased me all this way here?

00:43:37.340 --> 00:43:38.420
Hey, behind you!

00:43:42.970 --> 00:43:44.470
Damn it!

00:44:00.610 --> 00:44:02.570
Hey, let's get out of here!

00:44:14.790 --> 00:44:15.680
What?!

00:44:32.810 --> 00:44:35.140
Wh-What the hell am I watching?

00:44:54.170 --> 00:44:54.920
This is bad!

00:44:54.920 --> 00:44:56.290
The dimension is falling apart!

00:44:56.430 --> 00:44:59.040
Please hurry up and get away from this place!

00:45:22.780 --> 00:45:24.530
Ow...

00:45:29.730 --> 00:45:30.980
A mannequin?

00:45:30.980 --> 00:45:33.000
Huh, everything's back to normal?

00:45:33.000 --> 00:45:33.840
Oh, yeah!

00:45:33.840 --> 00:45:35.870
Gil! Pani! Are you okay?!

00:45:39.820 --> 00:45:41.590
Was I dreaming or something?

00:45:43.750 --> 00:45:46.930
For now, I've got to hurry 
to where the witch is.

00:45:47.430 --> 00:45:49.430
<b>To K.T. Carry the Colonel to the Room</b>

00:45:50.980 --> 00:45:53.180
E-Excuse me...

00:45:58.380 --> 00:46:01.240
Miss Witch, are you here?

00:46:04.820 --> 00:46:06.360
Wh-What?

00:46:18.850 --> 00:46:20.960
Welcome, Gypsy,

00:46:22.690 --> 00:46:24.970
to my mystical room.

00:46:29.180 --> 00:46:34.470
Episode 1:
 "The World or Myself?"
